An alternative way to set the palettes is to use the #NormalTok("pick_palette()"); function. It allows you to pick the colors for each class manually by clicking on top of the imported image. We can use one of the original images or a composite image with portions of several leaves. Let's use here one of the original images and pick the background colors and assign them to the #NormalTok("b"); vector.

