=== Reading the dataset
<reading-the-dataset>
The following code assumes you have already downloaded the #cite(<HuichunYE2023>, form: "prose") dataset and unzipped its content under the #emph[data/banana\_data] directory.

=== File formats
<file-formats>
Let's list the files under each subfolder:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#FunctionTok("list.files");#NormalTok("(");#StringTok("\"data/banana_data/1_UAV multispectral reflectance\"");#NormalTok(")");],));
