Now we will extract raster values at point locations using the #NormalTok("st_extract()"); function from the {stars} library. It is expected that a value per band is extracted at each point.

We need to convert the #emph[raster] object into a #emph[stars] object:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("sss ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("st_as_stars");#NormalTok("(rrr)");],));
]
What we got?

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("sss");],));
#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("stars_proxy object with 1 attribute in 1 file(s):");],
[#NormalTok("$`UAV multispectral reflectance.tif`");],
