=== Computing vegetation indices
<computing-vegetation-indices>
#cite(<ye2020>, form: "prose") used the following indices (#ref(<fig-RS12>, supplement: [Figure])):

#figure([
#box(image("imgs/RS_VIs.png"))
], caption: figure.caption(
separator: "", 
position: bottom, 
[
#block[
]
]), 
kind: "quarto-float-fig", 
supplement: "Figure", 
)
<fig-RS12>


Thus, we will compute several of those indices:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("buf_indices ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok("  buf_values2 ");#SpecialCharTok("|>");#NormalTok(" ");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#FunctionTok("mutate");#NormalTok("(");#AttributeTok("ndvi =");#NormalTok(" (nir ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" red) ");#SpecialCharTok("/");#NormalTok(" (nir");#SpecialCharTok("+");#NormalTok("red),");],
[#NormalTok("         ");#AttributeTok("ndre =");#NormalTok(" (nir ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" redge) ");#SpecialCharTok("/");#NormalTok(" (nir");#SpecialCharTok("+");#NormalTok("redge),");],
[#NormalTok("          ");#AttributeTok("cire =");#NormalTok(" (nir ");#SpecialCharTok("/");#NormalTok(" redge) ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("          ");#AttributeTok("sipi =");#NormalTok(" (nir ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" blue) ");#SpecialCharTok("/");#NormalTok(" (nir ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" red)");],
[#NormalTok("  ) ");#SpecialCharTok("|>");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("select");#NormalTok("(ndvi, ndre, cire, sipi)");],));
]
