Now, we will need to join the CLS severity data to the spectral covariates data.

Let's recall how the CLS data are structured:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("cls");],));
#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("# A tibble: 136 × 9");],
[#NormalTok("    Plot    D0    D1    D2    D3    D4    D5    D6  year");],
