Let's estimate the training accuracy:

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("rf_training_pred ");#SpecialCharTok("|>");#NormalTok(" ");#CommentTok("# training set predictions");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#FunctionTok("accuracy");#NormalTok("(");#AttributeTok("truth =");#NormalTok(" category, .pred_class) ");#OtherTok("->");#NormalTok(" acc_train");],
