== Visualize the DPCs
<visualize-the-dpcs>
Before proceeding with model selection and fitting, let's visualize the three epidemics. The code below closely reproduces the top plot of Fig. 4.15 (#cite(<chapter2007b>, form: "prose") page 94). The appraisal of the curves might give us a hint on which models are the best candidates.

Because the data was entered in the wide format (each DPC is in a different column) we need to reshape it to the long format. The #NormalTok("pivot_longer()"); function will do the job of reshaping from wide to long format so we can finally use the #NormalTok("ggplot()"); function to produce the plot.

