We can visualize the daily and cumulative DSV for the monthly period after transforming the date format using #NormalTok("as.Date()"); function. The dashed horizontal line in the plot indicates the action threshold of 20 cumulative DSV points, or when a spray should be applied. Please note that in real systems, the DSV is reduced to zero and another DSV counting is initiated after the spray.

