#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("wet");#SpecialCharTok("$");#NormalTok("yscaled ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("rescale");#NormalTok("(wet");#SpecialCharTok("$");#NormalTok("y) ");],
