==== Integrating temperature and wetness effects
<integrating-temperature-and-wetness-effects>
The equations developed for the separate effects can be integrated to create a surface response curve or a simple contour plot. Let's first integrate the generalized beta and the monomolecular models for the original severity data for the citrus canker experiment.

First, we need a data frame for the interaction between temperature $t$ and hours of wetness $h w$. Then, we obtain the disease value for each combination of $t$ and $h w$.

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("t ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("rep");#NormalTok("(");#DecValTok("1");#SpecialCharTok(":");#DecValTok("40");#NormalTok(", ");#DecValTok("40");#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("hw ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("rep");#NormalTok("(");#DecValTok("1");#SpecialCharTok(":");#DecValTok("40");#NormalTok(", ");#AttributeTok("each =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("40");#NormalTok(")");],
[],
[#CommentTok("# let's fit the two models again and store the parameters in objects");],
[#CommentTok("# Temperature effects");],
[#NormalTok("fit_temp ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("nlsLM");#NormalTok("(");],
[#NormalTok("  y ");#SpecialCharTok("~");#NormalTok(" a ");#SpecialCharTok("*");#NormalTok(" ((t ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" b) ");#SpecialCharTok("^");#NormalTok(" d) ");#SpecialCharTok("*");#NormalTok(" ((c ");#SpecialCharTok("-");#NormalTok(" t) ");#SpecialCharTok("^");#NormalTok(" e),");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#AttributeTok("start =");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("list");#NormalTok("(");],
[#NormalTok("    ");#AttributeTok("a =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("0");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("    ");#AttributeTok("b =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("10");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("    ");#AttributeTok("c =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("40");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("    ");#AttributeTok("d =");#NormalTok(" ");#FloatTok("1.5");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("    ");#AttributeTok("e =");#NormalTok(" ");#DecValTok("1");],
[#NormalTok("  ),");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#AttributeTok("algorithm =");#NormalTok(" ");#StringTok("\"port\"");#NormalTok(",");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#AttributeTok("data =");#NormalTok(" temp");],
[#NormalTok(")");],
[#NormalTok("fit_temp");#SpecialCharTok("$");#NormalTok("m");#SpecialCharTok("$");#FunctionTok("getAllPars");#NormalTok("()");],));
#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("          a           b           c           d           e ");],
[#NormalTok(" 0.00130259 11.99999931 40.13723602  1.76010097  0.83086798 ");],));
]
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("a ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" fit_temp");#SpecialCharTok("$");#NormalTok("m");#SpecialCharTok("$");#FunctionTok("getAllPars");#NormalTok("()[");#DecValTok("1");#NormalTok("]");],
