The weather data for our analysis will be downloaded from NASA POWER. Since we have multiple trials with different heading dates, a wrapper function for the #NormalTok("get_power()"); function from the {nasapower} package was created, included in {r4pde}, and named #NormalTok("get_nasapower()");. This function enables the download of data for a period "around" the key date, which can be defined by the user. In our case, we will download data from 28 days before and 28 days after the heading date.

#block[
#Skylighting(([#NormalTok("weather_data ");#OtherTok("<-");#NormalTok(" ");#FunctionTok("get_nasapower");#NormalTok("(");],
[#NormalTok("  ");#AttributeTok("data =");#NormalTok(" trials,");],
